* If you need help ...
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
1.  If you have SAC Community Edition working, use the help command from
    within SAC.  You can print hard-copies of the help files using printhelp.
2.  Some features of SAC are described in the CHANGES file in this directory.
3.  A place to share problems and find solutions is the SAC Community mailing
    list: <sac-community@earthscope.org>, signup here:
    https://groups.google.com/a/earthscope.org/g/sac-community

